WEBVTT

38:31.335 --> 38:33.045
My apologies if I've given offense.

38:33.170 --> 38:35.756
I know how to play a man like Drogo.

38:35.882 --> 38:38.676
I give him a queen
and he gives me an army.

38:39.594 --> 38:41.637
I don't want to be his queen.

38:46.726 --> 38:48.102
I want to go home.

38:48.769 --> 38:50.104
So do I.

38:51.272 --> 38:53.566
I want us both to go home,

38:53.691 --> 38:55.902
but they took it from us.

38:56.027 --> 38:57.820
So tell me, sweet sister,

38:57.945 --> 38:59.614
how do we go home?
